---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "Marketing Agency in Nigeria | RavensOrbit Digital"
description: "RavensOrbit is a marketing agency in Nigeria that connects paid ads, SEO, conversion and customer retention into one plan that brings in customers."
navKey: "home"
permalink: "/"
schema: true
identityWidget: true
---
<header class="hero">
    <canvas data-orbit="hero" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div><h1 class="label">Marketing agency in Nigeria</h1><p class="display-1 fx">Put your brand in orbit.</p></div>
      <div class="side fx">
        <p class="lede">Most brands run ads in one place, SEO in another and customer follow-up nowhere. We connect all of it, so the people who notice you go on to buy from you and come back.</p>
        <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-copper" href="/book/">Book a free strategy call <span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/work/">See our work</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="trust">
    <div class="wrap trust-head"><h2 class="trust-title">Brands our team has worked with.</h2><p>A selection of organisations our team has supported across content strategy, editorial, production and brand storytelling.</p></div>
    <div class="marquee" id="marquee" aria-label="Brands our team has worked with"><div class="track" id="track"></div></div>
  </div>

  <section class="problem" id="problem">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head" style="margin-bottom:44px"><div class="label">[ The problem ]</div><h2 class="fx" id="journeyTitle">Your customer sees one journey. Most brands build it in pieces.</h2></div>
      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="reveal-text" id="problemText">
            <p>The ad says one thing. The website says another. Sign-up takes eight steps. And after someone buys, nobody talks to them again.</p>
            <p>Each part might look fine on its own report. But customers don't experience your marketing in parts. They experience one journey, and they leave at the weakest point.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="reveal-text" style="margin-top:22px"><span><span class="mark reset" id="problemMark">We find that point and fix it, then make sure everything around it pulls in the same direction.</span></span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey">
          <div class="state-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Compare the customer journey">
            <button type="button" data-pieces="apart" aria-pressed="true">Without us</button>
            <button type="button" data-pieces="joined" aria-pressed="false">With us</button>
          </div>
          <div class="pieces" id="pieces">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse id="piecesOrbit" cx="50" cy="50" rx="38" ry="36" fill="none" stroke="rgba(117,182,131,.5)" stroke-width=".3" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-dasharray="4 6" style="opacity:0;transition:opacity .8s"/></svg>
            <div class="core" aria-hidden="true">Your<br>customer</div>
            <div class="piece" data-a="-8,-4,-9" style="left:4%;top:4%"><div class="k"><span></span><span></span></div><b></b></div>
            <div class="piece" data-a="10,6,7" style="right:2%;top:16%"><div class="k"><span></span><span></span></div><b></b></div>
            <div class="piece" data-a="8,-6,-5" style="right:6%;bottom:2%"><div class="k"><span></span><span></span></div><b></b></div>
            <div class="piece" data-a="-6,8,6" style="left:0;bottom:16%"><div class="k"><span></span><span></span></div><b></b></div>
          </div>
          <p class="journey-cap" id="journeyCap" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="forces">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="label">[ What we do ]</div><div><h2 class="fx">Four forces. One plan.</h2></div></div>
      <div class="forces">
        <a class="force fx" href="/services/"><div class="illus"><canvas data-illus="performance" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div><div class="body"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Performance Marketing</h3><p>Paid campaigns on Meta, TikTok, Google and YouTube, judged by the customers they bring in, not the clicks.</p></div></a>
        <a class="force fx" href="/services/"><div class="illus" data-illus-dom="search"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Search &amp; AI Visibility</h3><p>Show up when people search on Google, and when they ask ChatGPT, Gemini or Perplexity which brand to pick.</p></div></a>
        <a class="force fx" href="/services/"><div class="illus" data-illus-dom="conversion"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Conversion</h3><p>Landing pages, onboarding and checkout that make the next step easy to take.</p></div></a>
        <a class="force fx" href="/services/"><div class="illus"><canvas data-illus="lifecycle" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div><div class="body"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Lifecycle &amp; Retention</h3><p>Email, SMS, push, WhatsApp and CRM that bring customers back after the first purchase.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="light" id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="label">[ How we work ]</div><div><h2 class="fx">Understand. Execute. Improve.</h2></div></div>
      <div class="process reset" data-process>
        <div class="step"><div class="ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle class="bg" cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle class="fg" cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" style="transition-delay:0s"/></svg><span class="n">01</span></div><h3>Understand</h3><p>We look at your market, your audience and what your current marketing is actually delivering. Then we tell you plainly where growth is stuck.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle class="bg" cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle class="fg" cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" style="transition-delay:.5s"/></svg><span class="n">02</span></div><h3>Execute</h3><p>We build the plan and do the work: campaigns, pages, content, customer messaging.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle class="bg" cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle class="fg" cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" style="transition-delay:1s"/></svg><span class="n">03</span></div><h3>Improve</h3><p>Every month we keep what works, drop what doesn't and build on the last month instead of starting over.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="light" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="label">[ Why us ]</div><div><h2 class="fx">Why RavensOrbit</h2></div></div>
      <div class="why">
        <div class="fx"><svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="13" stroke="#154F27" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="4" fill="#154F27"/><circle cx="26.5" cy="8" r="3" fill="#A36B44"/></svg><h3>One plan, not five vendors.</h3><p>Your ads, website, search and customer messaging are planned together.</p></div>
        <div class="fx"><svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="7" stroke="#154F27" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="22" cy="17" r="7" stroke="#A36B44" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><h3>The people you meet do the work.</h3><p>No handing your account to someone you've never spoken to.</p></div>
        <div class="fx"><svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none"><path d="M17 4c6 4 9 8.5 9 13s-3 9-9 13c-6-4-9-8.5-9-13s3-9 9-13Z" stroke="#154F27" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3" fill="#A36B44"/></svg><h3>We know this market.</h3><p>We understand how Nigerian and African audiences decide who to trust.</p></div>
        <div class="fx"><svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="7" width="24" height="20" rx="4" stroke="#154F27" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M10 21l5-5 4 3 5-6" stroke="#A36B44" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><h3>You always know where things stand.</h3><p>What we did, what it delivered, what's next. Every month.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% set posts = collections.post | reverse %}{% if posts.length %}<section id="journalTeaser">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="label">[ Journal ]</div><div><h2 class="fx">The Growth Journal</h2><p class="lede">What we're seeing across marketing, consumer behaviour and business growth in Africa.</p></div></div>
      <div class="journal">{% for post in posts | head(3) %}{% include "postcard.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
      <div style="margin-top:40px"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/journal/">Read the Journal <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>{% endif %}

  <section class="cta">
    <canvas data-orbit="cta" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="label">[ Let's talk ]</div>
      <h2 class="fx">Tell us where you want to grow.</h2>
      <p class="lede fx">More customers, better conversion, or getting existing customers to come back. On a free 30-minute call, we'll give you an honest view of what's in the way.</p>
      <div class="btn-row fx"><a class="btn btn-copper" href="/book/">Book a free strategy call <span class="arrow">→</span></a><span class="mail">{{ site.email }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
